          "name": "Microsoft Windows 10 List available sensors",
          "request": {
            "name": "Microsoft Windows 10 List available sensors",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves the list of available sensors on the device. Each sensor type uses a GetDefault() static method to check availability. Supported types include Accelerometer, Gyrometer, Compass, Inclinometer, LightSensor, Barometer, Altimeter, Magnetometer, OrientationSensor, Pedometer, ProximitySensor, ActivitySensor, HumanPresenceSensor, and HingeAngleSensor.",
